> là nhóm đầu tiên có tần số tích luỹ lớn hơn hoặc bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math>. Xét nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>70</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>  có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tÁp dụng công thức, ta có tứ phân vị thứ ba là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn>